", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "491830904_963008105878930_5609919356161729188_n.png", "id": "1068600215452464", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296077_1068600218785797_1895999254932483446_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KtY-pEPgoywQ7kNvwFRPoU-&_nc_oc=AdptGDW7Nrc1P25656weEfT4CTgrCzDYPWeDBMoTgviUvBm1y6LAbzapYez0hKZ051U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEdGHvyvvnx1zt3MX18sGFYi2QEw1UCYic_dvv0tPVCTg&oe=6A95DFD7"}, {"file_name": "499303745_754707867096135_5615368708002933664_n.png", "id": "2427580197616957", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298137_2427580200950290_1002148497796793518_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nr-Y_wmD284Q7kNvwGGBwvV&_nc_oc=Adq3q1dQIs45QdsJXHpmmZaWUjhwiiNzmAYGRqW7Z70eBZZvDdddj8z2zAj-3yb0p5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGq0Lh4srxi7DofxO7XMjnbXbOg4wBEBHIQ3KlRsO-LFg&oe=6A95CDBD"}, {"file_name": "491831060_722572903862684_1098629066312972239_n.png", "id": "1272061931207772", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1272061937874438_2500758606005063603_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9CM4p9vD65UQ7kNvwGFlB41&_nc_oc=AdpC-ZVK40RUsmcG3WEmm753FVbWSojbZj7AzjVix0B-yx4t7Lb_H3qGwtwTFXDS5dM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEx4UTlqCCjf2p4MxYwE1rdBV81dKB9utuftw_8lqDGYw&oe=6A95B786"}, {"file_name": "499303745_771192975599273_2925509274316122328_n.png", "id": "2553893141632767", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307574_2553893144966100_1099956943292571486_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DeHGh3bqRrMQ7kNvwE8f83y&_nc_oc=AdosN8tZMZerq84fTjCzCyqYxefymz3isrIvz5NY5tZ2kXtNKfsu4YmnTkKN9_GrtjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHFZQA6zIkKMdYX1LQlzLTmKWO7zle7TDT3xwb9LTRXcg&oe=6A95C5A7"}, {"file_name": "499617806_2563134857369512_8646765098608795994_n.png", "id": "760350869840961", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_760350873174294_2393252051292747123_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OB_dWJN5yuIQ7kNvwG4d6YJ&_nc_oc=AdrMQ_sgBdIsRzmhc2ehMvr3luBDZpPEDBMCCDO_DNBwgiIfEZeFxgicQ4WncZKLAP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE9EBhwXiWEHVcyAfHckuvz9HBQcmWQc4g7PwwEX--REg&oe=6A95CB62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Clock", "keywords": ["clock", "time", "stopwatch", "timer", "alarm"], "long_description": "### \u23f0 Quest Clock \u2014 Time Tools, Reimagined for VR\n\n**Quest Clock** is your lightweight, always-available time companion for the Meta Quest. Whether you're immersed in a game, watching a movie, or browsing the web, Quest Clock helps you **stay on track** without breaking your VR flow.\n\n#### \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Features:\n- **Digital Clock** \u2013 Keep an eye on the time, always.\n- **Timer** \u2013 Count down while you cook, exercise, or meditate.\n- **Stopwatch** \u2013 Track durations with precision.\n- **Alarm** \u2013 Set reminders without leaving VR.\n\n#### \ud83e\uddca Minimal Footprint, Maximum Utility:\nAt under **700 KB**, Quest Clock is **ultra-efficient**, consuming almost no memory or performance \u2014 perfect for multitasking without a drain on system resources.\n\n#### \ud83e\ude9f Floating Panels for Seamless Multitasking:\nEach tool appears as a **separate panel**, so you can position your clock, timer, or stopwatch wherever you need them \u2014 even **while other apps are running**.\n\n> \ud83c\udfa5 Watching a movie?  \n> \ud83c\udfae In the middle of a game?  \n> \ud83d\udcbb Working in your browser?  \n>  \n> **Your time tools are always within reach.**\n\n#### \ud83d\udd0b Lightweight & Efficient:\nQuest Clock is designed to run with **minimal memory usage** and **low CPU consumption**, so it doesn't interfere with other apps. It\u2019s the perfect time companion without draining resources or affecting performance.\n\n#### \u2728 Multi-tasking, Simplified:\nQuest Clock is always available, allowing you to **track time** while focusing on your VR experience. It ensures you can multitask", "short_description": "Stay on time in VR with Quest Clock \u2014 a lightweight, multitasking-friendly clock app for Meta Quest. Includes a timer, stopwatch, digital clock, and alarm. Panels can float beside any app, so you can track time while gaming, watching videos, or browsing. Under 700 KB and ultra-efficient, it's the perfect time companion for your headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nparashuram.github.io/quest-clock/privacy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ram N", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nparashuram.github.io/quest-clock/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD", "HAND_TRACKING", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24179974701619195"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1080863457323096"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1080863457323096"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1753914600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1080863457323096"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": 